 {"id": "DF-2026-9", "status": "complete", "priority": "P2", "title": "P2 — CLI space-form namespace flag silently resolves to namespace true instead of consuming the next argument", "acceptance_criteria": "In an isolated config, `node bin/duckbrain.js status --namespace dogfood1027` prints Namespace: dogfood1027 and the configured scratch path, matching `--namespace=dogfood1027`; a missing value or unknown namespace fails loudly rather than resolving to true/default; add a regression test for the space form.", "reasoning": "Dogfood tick duckbrain-dogfood-2026-10-27-20-29-19, current HEAD db695496bbfc68fd24e24940f095f951b64a2bea. In an isolated scratch store, `node bin/duckbrain.js status --namespace dogfood1027` exited 0 but printed Namespace: true and Path: ./memory/default, while `--namespace=dogfood1027` printed the intended namespace and path. This is silent wrong-state behavior in a documented CLI flag family; equals form works, space form is accepted but misparsed. Reproduction evidence: /tmp/df-dkb-1027/status-space.txt. Fix the shared CLI parser or status parser to consume space-form values and reject ambiguous boolean fallback.", "source": null, "created_by": null, "created_at": "2026-10-27T20:51:41.014705+00:00", "ts": null, "updated_at": "2026-10-27T20:51:41.014705+00:00", "capability_tags": ["cli", "usability", "bug"], "complexity": 1, "detail": {"fingerprint": "af9f9a1e4a4cb3d0ea80189179fb7927cbc6e8aec8fb53c6303b51f483c9995a"}, "commit_hash": "a32f3b9b44c3f372a4c11bbc9ec9b3ef2b4aaec9", "worker_status": "complete", "branch": "wt/DF-2026-9", "worktree": "/home/kara/worktrees/duckbrain-DF-2026-9 (merged, reaped)", "files_changed": "src/cli/human.ts, src/cli/status-namespace-df2026-9.test.ts", "lines_added": 346, "lines_removed": 2, "guard_result": "tier2 INCOMPLETE (verdict c371acf6) — NOT converted to a pass. tier1 tests PASS (235 files/1960 tests); tier1 secrets FAIL = pre-existing DF-2026-10. The judge ran the shipped entry point in this repo and got t